<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- Functional-line fix for weapon blocks that have no tech-component patch (so they are not in
     TechCosts-BasicWeapons.xml or TechCosts-Weapons.xml). Each block here has a Computer component
     but its source mod sets CriticalComponent to the first SteelPlate (or a Motor), so the block
     becomes functional long before the Computer is built while the hack line (ownership) sits
     right after the Computer. This moves CriticalComponent to the Computer (Index 0) so the
     functional line matches the hack line, the same rule as the tech-cost files. Component lists
     are reproduced unchanged from each source mod's own .sbc; only CriticalComponent differs.
     Weapons in the BasicWeapons and Weapons ShipCore groups only. Blocks with no Computer at all
     and blocks whose source already uses the Computer are left alone. Added 2026-09-20. -->
